  Gift Study main results paper, both those presented in the
  paper and all other analyses done as part of the
  development of the published material including model
  checks, exploratory analyses and reviewer requested
  analyses. In addition the statistical code used in
  producing tables, figures and all primary and
  supplementary analyses is made avaiable.
